  m_Text: 'This is an example for how the "Underwater Area" component

    may be
    used to switch the underwater rendering to a different

    water material and
    water level.


    Make sure to make the Box Collider is slightly higher than
    the actual

    water level, to ensure that the trigger occurs before the bottom

    of
    the screen touches the water'
